    "img": "icons/skills/wounds/injury-triple-slash-bleed.webp",
    "name": "Sky: Zenith (Scorpio)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>&#9807; <strong>Scorpio rises Exalted today.</strong> This is the one day in two hundred and sixty. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were 8 levels higher, and you have your Zenith Boon.</p><p>Needles land on any attack you make against a creature, hit or miss. Each needle deals @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage, stacking, capped at 10 needles of bleed.</p><p>At <strong>5</strong> needles the creature must attempt a Fortitude save against your Cosmo DC or die. <em>Incapacitation.</em></p><p>Your allies' hits apply needles too: at the start of each of your turns every ally on the field is given @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Effect: The Scorpion's Blessing], which carries the needle for them. They are given it once, not once a turn.</p><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. A Zenith is scheduled by the GM, never rolled.</p>"
        },
